{"id": 2361, "title": "Make the Loss Cute", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "make-the-loss-cute", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2361_make-the-loss-cute.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["有个人买了一双新鞋子，他非常喜欢，所以他穿着新鞋子坐火车去见女朋友。但是在火车上，他的一只鞋子从火车上掉了下去。大家都觉得很可惜，但是他立即把第二只鞋子也扔了下去。大家觉得很奇怪，这个人说：“这一只鞋子对我来说已经没有用了，但是如果有人能捡到一双鞋子，说不定他还能穿呢！”"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["有個人買了一雙新鞋子，他非常喜歡，所以他穿著新鞋子坐火車去見女朋友。但是在火車上，他的一隻鞋子從火車上掉了下去。大家都覺得很可惜，但是他立即把第二隻鞋子也扔了下去。大家覺得很奇怪，這個人說：“這一隻鞋子對我來說已經沒有用了，但是如果有人能撿到一雙鞋子，說不定他還能穿呢！”"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yǒu gè rén mǎi le yī shuāng xīn xié zi， tā fēi cháng xǐ huan， suǒ yǐ tā chuān zhe xīn xié zi zuò huǒ chē qù jiàn nǚ péng you。 dàn shì zài huǒ chē shàng， tā de yī zhī xié zi cóng huǒ chē shàng diào le xià qù。 dà jiā dōu jué de hěn kě xī， dàn shì tā lì jí bǎ dì èr zhī xié zi yě rēng le xià qù。 dà jiā jué de hěn qí guài， zhè gè rén shuō：“ zhè yī zhī xié zi duì wǒ lái shuō yǐ jīng méi yǒu yòng le， dàn shì rú guǒ yǒu rén néng jiǎn dào yī shuāng xié zi， shuō bu dìng tā hái néng chuān ne！”"], "english_paragraphs": ["A man bought a new pair of shoes that he liked very much, so he wore them on the train to visit his girlfriend. But during the ride, one of his shoes fell off the train. Everyone thought it was a shame, but he immediately threw the other shoe off too. Everyone was puzzled. The man said, “One shoe is no use to me now, but if someone finds the pair, they might be able to wear them!”"], "english_full": "A man bought a new pair of shoes that he liked very much, so he wore them on the train to visit his girlfriend. But during the ride, one of his shoes fell off the train. Everyone thought it was a shame, but he immediately threw the other shoe off too. Everyone was puzzled. The man said, “One shoe is no use to me now, but if someone finds the pair, they might be able to wear them!”", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\"